{{also|Nigra}}
==English==

===Etymology===
A collateral form of {{m|en|negro}} with colloquial reduction of unstressed {{IPAchar|/oʊ/|/əʊ/}} to {{IPAchar|/ə/}} as in {{m|en|fella}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈnɪɡɹə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|offensive|ethnic slur}} A [[black]] person.
